# Global ignores are for cruft that no repository ever wants: files the OS or
# an editor drops next to your work. Build output, archives, logs and
# databases are project decisions and belong in each repo's own .gitignore;
# ignoring them here hides them from every repo, including ones that track
# them on purpose.

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# Vim / Neovim swap files
*.swp
*.swo

# Claude Code per-user overrides (the shared settings.json stays tracked)
**/.claude/settings.local.json
